Package: globalkoma
Title: The VJA Multi-Country Macro Model, Built on koma
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Laurent", "Florin", , "laurent.f94@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Panel helpers, pre-flight checks, estimation, diagnostics and
    forecasting for the VJA multi-country Bayesian simultaneous-equations
    model, built on the 'koma' package. The model itself is one explicit koma
    equation string; the scripts that build its data, panel and fit live in
    scratch/. Library management with 'renv'.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
